WEBVTT

00:26.340 --> 00:28.890
Lettie? Where are you?

00:32.030 --> 00:33.240
Prince Matthias.

00:33.240 --> 00:34.100
Uh...

00:36.390 --> 00:37.420
Huh?

00:45.000 --> 00:48.350
My, Prince Matthias. What a bad boy!

00:48.350 --> 00:51.040
You mustn't go wandering around by yourself.

00:52.970 --> 00:56.560
Well then, shall we return to your room,

00:56.560 --> 00:58.870
Prince Matthias?

01:01.370 --> 01:05.960
No!

02:52.480 --> 02:54.220
Good afternoon, everyone.

02:54.220 --> 02:59.030
I, Leticia Dorman, am now 
officially Leticia Astarl!

03:01.290 --> 03:06.570
It was a lot to handle at first, but once 
things got rolling, we had a lovely wedding!

03:06.570 --> 03:10.850
Everyone gave us their kindest blessings. 
It was such a wonderful time!

03:10.850 --> 03:12.800
And Prince Clarke looked so handsome.

03:12.800 --> 03:13.800
Hah!

03:14.910 --> 03:15.950
Tee-hee!

03:17.940 --> 03:18.810
What's this?

03:21.770 --> 03:24.080
My, how positively rude.

03:29.860 --> 03:35.450
Duke Neil and Prince Nathan of Delbaran 
left us many wonderful gifts before departing.

03:35.450 --> 03:38.570
They even said, "Come visit us
 in Delbaran anytime!"

03:39.230 --> 03:40.600
I am so cool.

03:40.600 --> 03:42.330
I am so beautiful!

03:42.920 --> 03:44.910
Prince Louis and Lyle are still here, though.

03:44.910 --> 03:49.570
Oh, every day of my life 
is just rosy and full of joy now!

03:51.350 --> 03:52.340
That's a lie.

03:52.660 --> 03:56.390
Right now, I'm engaged in a battle 
with my self-control, pride, willpower,

03:56.390 --> 03:58.840
and all sorts of things on the line.

04:00.170 --> 04:02.620
You have no idea what
 I'm talking about, do you?

04:17.450 --> 04:21.210
I'm talking about what 
follows the wedding. Our, um...

04:21.570 --> 04:23.080
wedding... night...

04:23.600 --> 04:29.130
No! I get so embarrassed 
just thinking about it!

04:42.700 --> 04:44.480
You must be exhausted after today.

04:44.480 --> 04:46.570
Let's get to sleep early, Letici—

04:47.020 --> 04:48.030
Huh?

04:58.030 --> 04:59.030
Wuh?

05:00.850 --> 05:04.050
Sorry, sorry! Sweet dreams, Lettie.

05:04.050 --> 05:04.910
Huh?

05:13.600 --> 05:14.820
All that hard breathing...

05:15.510 --> 05:16.500
Hmm?

05:18.270 --> 05:19.760
You guys...

05:23.760 --> 05:25.760
What in the heavens is this?!

05:26.220 --> 05:28.830
A supremely sexy see-through negligee.

05:28.830 --> 05:32.020
A wedding gift for you. 
I know it's a little late, though.

05:32.020 --> 05:34.540
I can't wear anything so indecent!

05:34.540 --> 05:38.630
Really? I don't see the problem. 
You are newlyweds, after all.

05:38.630 --> 05:39.790
Maria can have it.

05:39.790 --> 05:42.280
You should be the one to wear it, missus!

05:42.680 --> 05:47.030
But in that, you could really blow 
Prince Louis's mind. Wouldn't that be fun?

05:47.030 --> 05:48.540
I'll pass.

05:48.540 --> 05:51.290
You're slipping back into old bad habits.

05:51.290 --> 05:54.540
Even married, you're still 
a little troublemaker.

05:54.540 --> 05:56.690
Oh, I do beg your pardon.

06:01.570 --> 06:03.590
She's so cute!

06:03.590 --> 06:08.420
She's your wife. You should quit spying, 
grow a spine, and go talk to her.

06:08.420 --> 06:10.560
This has been my routine for ten years.

06:10.560 --> 06:15.060
She sure looks like 
she's having fun, my, my...

06:15.060 --> 06:16.390
my wife.

06:18.830 --> 06:21.190
Well, you certainly seem pleased with yourself.

06:21.190 --> 06:25.380
Granted, this is all the culmination 
of my tireless planning, is it not?

06:25.380 --> 06:27.570
You just can't let it go, can you?

06:27.960 --> 06:30.580
Now all we need is an heir.

06:36.050 --> 06:39.130
What? You haven't consummated 
the marriage yet?!

06:39.550 --> 06:40.970
Yeah, that's right.

06:40.970 --> 06:42.130
Why not?!

06:42.130 --> 06:46.900
It's been a whole week since the wedding! 
Aren't you sleeping in the same room?

06:46.900 --> 06:50.440
Lettie is still really nervous about it,
so she pretends to fall asleep.

06:50.440 --> 06:54.730
Also, didn't I say I wouldn't lay a hand
on her until she wanted me to?

06:54.730 --> 06:56.150
I can't believe this.

06:57.200 --> 06:58.900
You'll just have to be patient.

06:58.900 --> 07:01.760
No, that's not the part that bothers me.

07:02.900 --> 07:03.810
Hmm?

07:04.940 --> 07:07.490
She's so cute!

07:08.370 --> 07:11.410
You cannot predict the actions 
of a man crazy with love.

07:11.410 --> 07:14.120
Hey! To-doo doo-doo, to-doo!

07:12.070 --> 07:14.840
Mmm. Yeah. Uh-huh.

07:14.840 --> 07:16.920
Hey! To-doo doo-doo, to-doo!

07:16.920 --> 07:18.150
Aw yeah.

07:18.150 --> 07:19.920
To-doo doo-doo, to-doo!

07:18.760 --> 07:19.920
Hey. Oomph!

07:23.760 --> 07:24.700
If you please...

07:24.700 --> 07:26.510
From the Kingdom of Delbaran,

07:26.510 --> 07:30.440
the sweet and sexy Prince Louis 
has arrived for your pleasure!

07:30.440 --> 07:31.970
Ya oughta show some gratitude.

07:31.970 --> 07:32.930
True that.

07:35.730 --> 07:37.080
Hey, why aren—

07:38.850 --> 07:39.560
Swoop!

07:39.560 --> 07:43.790
Ooh, coochie coochie coo! 
Coochie coochie coo!

07:43.790 --> 07:45.470
Ah, Your Highness!

07:44.330 --> 07:45.470
Zoom!

07:46.880 --> 07:50.880
You think you can get away 
with doing that to me?!

07:50.880 --> 07:53.250
Yes, of course I can get away with it!

07:53.800 --> 07:57.350
Because I'm now Astarl's cro... cro...

07:57.350 --> 07:59.330
crown princess, you know?!

07:59.330 --> 08:03.590
You're all tongue-tied! 
I can tell you aren't used to saying it yet.

08:05.140 --> 08:09.320
I am the crown princess! And you are 
the <i>third</i> prince of another kingdom.

08:09.320 --> 08:11.140
You know where that puts you?

08:11.140 --> 08:14.270
Whoa, look at you flaunting your authority!

08:14.270 --> 08:18.350
Hey, can't you take your stress out 
on something other than Prince Louis?

08:18.350 --> 08:19.570
For real!

08:19.570 --> 08:22.850
My lady, you're slipping
 into bad habits again.

08:22.850 --> 08:23.820
Hmph!

08:23.820 --> 08:27.930
Honestly, you almost act 
like two close siblings.

08:27.930 --> 08:28.820
Wuh?

08:29.340 --> 08:32.840
I always did want a cute little sister.

08:33.380 --> 08:34.330
What?

08:35.540 --> 08:37.540
This'll go easier if you don't put up a fight.

08:37.540 --> 08:39.290
Wh-What?

08:39.290 --> 08:41.760
What? What, what, what?

08:41.760 --> 08:44.040
What?!

08:44.410 --> 08:46.930
Will this be sufficient, you think?

08:46.930 --> 08:48.750
Yes! How very pretty!

08:48.750 --> 08:50.370
What an absolute surprise!

08:50.370 --> 08:52.300
I could see this becoming a habit.

08:52.300 --> 08:55.060
Like uncle, like nephew, I guess.

08:55.060 --> 08:57.980
You sure did bring a lot, though.

08:57.980 --> 09:01.370
I was thinking of selling them 
to people working at the castle.

09:01.370 --> 09:05.550
Imagine wearing the same negligee as
the future queen. Wouldn't that be great?

09:05.550 --> 09:07.070
In what way, exactly?

09:07.070 --> 09:11.140
Maybe I should buy something 
for my beloved back home.

09:11.140 --> 09:13.570
I guarantee she'd be thrilled!

09:13.570 --> 09:16.860
As for you, Lily and Maria, if you see 
one you like, just let me know.

09:16.860 --> 09:18.270
You wouldn't mind?

09:18.270 --> 09:20.400
They seem too expensive for me.

09:20.400 --> 09:24.880
Not to worry! They're quality products, 
but the price is very affordable.

09:24.880 --> 09:26.920
Don't just leave me sitting here!

09:27.840 --> 09:31.830
I have a wide variety, too. 
There's the pristine see-through type,

09:31.830 --> 09:34.150
the kind of wild see-through type,

09:34.150 --> 09:36.330
and even the dainty fairy see-through type!

09:36.330 --> 09:38.380
Why do they all have to be see-through?

09:38.380 --> 09:39.230
How lovely.

09:39.230 --> 09:40.060
Hmm?

09:39.230 --> 09:40.060
Huh?

09:40.410 --> 09:42.560
I'll take ten at your asking price.

09:42.560 --> 09:44.960
Wuh?! Prince Clarke!

09:44.960 --> 09:47.460
Thank you very much for your patronage!

09:47.970 --> 09:49.920
You sure have a lot of different designs.

09:49.920 --> 09:53.180
There's no way I'm wearing 
anything this indecent!

09:53.180 --> 09:54.870
Would you please just get out?

09:54.870 --> 09:56.330
H-Hey, Lettie...

09:56.790 --> 09:58.770
Prince Louis and Lyle, you too!

09:58.770 --> 10:00.100
Say what?

09:58.770 --> 10:00.100
Aww!

10:00.100 --> 10:02.830
Good kids go home before it gets late.

10:02.830 --> 10:05.010
Quit treatin' me like a child!

10:05.010 --> 10:07.280
I still haven't chosen one yet.

10:07.280 --> 10:08.840
I still haven't chosen ten—

10:08.840 --> 10:12.590
The coed cultural exchange 
lounge is now closed!

10:12.590 --> 10:17.560
Maria! Tell me which one you like later 
and I'll buy it as a present!

10:17.560 --> 10:18.380
Not interested.

10:18.380 --> 10:20.050
Quit hitting on Maria!

10:20.050 --> 10:21.790
Whadja just say, runt?

10:21.790 --> 10:23.290
Lettie! Lettie, I'll see you later!

10:23.290 --> 10:24.760
Highness, it's time to go.

10:24.760 --> 10:27.070
Hurry up and get the hell out!

10:27.070 --> 10:29.090
My lady, please do not be vulgar.

10:29.090 --> 10:30.430
Grr!

10:30.430 --> 10:32.610
Just wed, and he's
already getting kicked out...

10:45.710 --> 10:49.860
Lettie and Brudder, Mattie is leaving.

11:07.730 --> 11:11.430
Prince Matthias, where have you run off to?

11:11.430 --> 11:13.490
Prince Matthias!

11:14.870 --> 11:16.720
Prince Matthias!

11:16.720 --> 11:18.010
Headmistress Laila?

11:19.760 --> 11:21.290
What is going on here?

11:21.290 --> 11:25.380
Princess Leticia, I simply cannot 
find Prince Matthias anywhere.

11:25.380 --> 11:26.330
Huh?

11:26.990 --> 11:30.590
If anything happened, I don't know
 what I'd do! Everything's spinning...

11:31.610 --> 11:35.730
I will help you search. You should 
let yourself rest a while, headmistress.

11:35.730 --> 11:37.610
Then I will leave things to you.

11:37.610 --> 11:38.880
All right. Lily?

11:38.880 --> 11:39.410
Yes.

11:39.410 --> 11:40.030
Maria?

11:40.030 --> 11:40.880
Yes.

11:44.130 --> 11:47.020
Where could Prince Matthias be?

11:47.020 --> 11:49.520
Where has he gone?

11:47.330 --> 11:49.030
Prince Matthias...

11:49.520 --> 11:51.520
Prince Matthias!

11:51.520 --> 11:54.280
Oh, this is awful! Simply awful!

11:54.280 --> 11:56.290
What shall we do about this? 
What shall we do?

11:54.900 --> 11:56.290
Prince Matthias?

11:56.290 --> 11:58.030
Are you there, Prince Matthias?

11:58.030 --> 11:59.150
Prince Matthias?

11:59.150 --> 12:00.280
Where could he be?

12:00.280 --> 12:01.300
My!

12:01.300 --> 12:02.630
Oh, Prince Matthias...

12:03.290 --> 12:04.110
Anything?

12:04.110 --> 12:05.290
No.

12:04.110 --> 12:05.290
He's nowhere to be found.

12:05.740 --> 12:06.950
Lettie!

12:06.950 --> 12:09.570
Prince Clarke. Have you found him?

12:09.570 --> 12:11.110
No, not yet.

12:11.500 --> 12:13.570
I'll try looking on the other side.

12:13.570 --> 12:15.210
Okay, sounds good.

12:15.710 --> 12:17.700
We should split up as well.

12:17.700 --> 12:19.130
Understood.

12:19.130 --> 12:20.130
All right.

12:20.550 --> 12:27.310
Prince Matthias! Prince Matthias!

12:34.900 --> 12:36.700
Prince Matthias...

12:43.490 --> 12:44.500
Ah!

12:46.080 --> 12:50.560
Hello, Prince Matthias? 
Where are you? It's Leticia.

12:50.560 --> 12:54.430
Nobody else is here with me, 
so please respond, okay?

12:54.430 --> 12:56.260
Prince Matthias?

12:57.270 --> 12:58.990
Lettie... Ah!

12:58.990 --> 12:59.840
Oh!

13:04.030 --> 13:06.600
I've found you, Prince Matthias.

13:06.600 --> 13:07.770
Oh...

13:09.230 --> 13:10.350
Yeah.

13:11.010 --> 13:16.130
Prince Matthias, you really should go home. 
Everyone is very worried about you.

13:16.660 --> 13:18.020
No.

13:18.020 --> 13:20.960
Did you get tired of studying?

13:20.960 --> 13:23.930
No, I like studying.

13:24.430 --> 13:29.120
Then what happened? 
You can tell me all about it.

13:34.630 --> 13:37.390
Okay, then here I come!

13:52.160 --> 13:54.040
"You must not strike!"

13:54.040 --> 13:57.500
Her stately voice rang 
throughout the Roman bath.

13:57.500 --> 14:02.650
The hero Dale swiftly lowered his axe 
and flew past the monstrous milou.

14:03.040 --> 14:07.070
In the end, the milou was
 only looking for its child.

14:07.070 --> 14:09.600
"Bye-bye! Let's play again, okay?"

14:09.600 --> 14:14.900
The boy was very sad to be 
separated from the baby milou,

14:14.900 --> 14:17.170
but he managed a smile as he said farewell.

14:17.510 --> 14:21.920
With a squeal of joy, the baby milou 
gave its own farewell in return,

14:22.410 --> 14:25.510
which put a smile on everybody's face.

14:25.510 --> 14:27.560
And they lived happily ever after.

14:28.330 --> 14:29.930
Then what?

14:29.930 --> 14:31.140
Huh?

14:31.140 --> 14:38.140
Um, well, the hero Dale and his children 
departed on a new adventure!

14:38.140 --> 14:40.390
And they lived happily ever after.

14:40.390 --> 14:41.520
An adventure?

14:41.520 --> 14:43.450
Yes, an adventure.

14:43.450 --> 14:44.370
Oh, that's right.

14:44.830 --> 14:46.080
What?

14:46.080 --> 14:48.110
This is a treasure map.

14:48.110 --> 14:51.450
Look very closely now. 
Do you see that mark there?

14:52.260 --> 14:53.260
Huh?

14:58.460 --> 15:02.960
"May you smile and happiness shine brightly

15:02.960 --> 15:05.920
no matter what storms come your way."

15:07.970 --> 15:09.480
Lettie?

15:14.390 --> 15:17.480
It says that there's a treasure hidden here!

15:17.480 --> 15:18.800
Wow!

15:18.800 --> 15:21.490
Someday, let's go on an adventure together.

15:21.870 --> 15:23.830
Together? Really?

15:24.330 --> 15:25.940
It's a promise.

15:25.940 --> 15:27.310
A promise!

15:30.420 --> 15:32.060
Prince Matthias?

15:35.360 --> 15:36.660
Hup...

15:43.920 --> 15:45.280
Isn't that...?

15:46.750 --> 15:49.250
Brudder, what's that?

15:49.710 --> 15:51.710
It's Lettie's music box.

15:51.710 --> 15:53.770
It's broken and won't play.

15:54.220 --> 15:56.830
If it's not fixed soon, 
Lettie is going to be sad.

15:56.830 --> 15:58.860
Is Lettie gonna cry?

15:58.860 --> 16:00.010
I'm gonna cry.

16:00.010 --> 16:00.860
Huh?

16:01.450 --> 16:04.650
But I'm looking for a craftsman 
to repair it, so it'll be okay.

16:04.650 --> 16:06.780
Prince Clarke, may I have a moment?

16:06.780 --> 16:08.020
Yes.

16:08.020 --> 16:11.480
I have drawn up a schedule 
for Prince Matthias's lessons.

16:11.480 --> 16:12.940
Would you mind taking a look?

16:12.940 --> 16:14.000
All right.

16:14.920 --> 16:18.870
I don't want you and Brudder to be sad.

16:18.870 --> 16:23.210
I don't want you to cry. 
So I went to look for a craftsman myself.

16:23.210 --> 16:27.030
But when I tried to go out, 
there were lots of grown-ups

16:27.030 --> 16:29.830
and I got scared, so I hid here.

16:31.560 --> 16:34.820
Prince Matthias! 
You're such a good little boy!

16:34.820 --> 16:37.890
Prince Clarke and I will be just fine!

16:37.890 --> 16:40.410
Lettie, I can't breathe!

16:40.410 --> 16:43.260
I'm not going to let you go!

17:09.110 --> 17:12.160
The prince has been found.

17:25.150 --> 17:27.080
Prince Clarke?

17:27.890 --> 17:29.190
Are you awake?

17:29.940 --> 17:31.990
Where's Prince Matthias?

17:32.470 --> 17:34.530
Sleeping in his room.

17:34.530 --> 17:36.520
Thank goodness.

17:36.520 --> 17:38.470
I found you both sound asleep.

17:38.470 --> 17:41.330
You were the one who found us?

17:41.330 --> 17:42.330
Indeed.

17:59.890 --> 18:00.810
Ma—

18:00.810 --> 18:01.790
Ma?

18:01.790 --> 18:05.140
Matthias's chubby cheeks are totally different!

18:05.140 --> 18:07.430
Yeah, I can't beat him there.

18:07.430 --> 18:12.100
Ah, no, I didn't mean to say that! I just...

18:12.100 --> 18:12.830
Hmm?

18:12.830 --> 18:14.350
Never mind!

18:18.240 --> 18:19.490
Aww!

18:20.500 --> 18:22.110
Good night!

18:29.620 --> 18:30.660
Leticia.

18:34.820 --> 18:38.010
Wuh? What are you laughing about?

18:38.010 --> 18:39.390
Gosh.

18:42.660 --> 18:46.640
Well, I was just thinking about 
how funny you've always been.

18:48.020 --> 18:49.510
That's so mean!

18:50.260 --> 18:52.030
No, I just mean...

18:52.380 --> 18:55.210
They are very dear memories. 
Every single one of them.

18:55.650 --> 18:57.440
Prince Clarke...

19:12.230 --> 19:13.010
Huh?

19:13.340 --> 19:16.270
If we go any further, I'm gonna pass out!

19:16.270 --> 19:17.400
Ah!

19:19.210 --> 19:21.830
Sure, Lettie. Let's go to sleep.

19:21.830 --> 19:22.770
Yes!

19:35.160 --> 19:36.420
I can't sleep a wink.

21:13.160 --> 21:14.240
Lettie.

21:15.380 --> 21:16.870
I was able to get it fixed.

21:22.850 --> 21:24.220
Thank goodness.

21:36.070 --> 21:37.890
Prince Clarke.

21:37.890 --> 21:39.590
What is it, Lettie?

21:40.970 --> 21:44.520
Will you continue to chase after me even now?

21:44.520 --> 21:45.870
Of course I will.

21:49.060 --> 21:50.680
I'll chase after you forever.

21:56.360 --> 22:00.550
Your Royal Highness Crown Princess 
Leticia Astarl, may I have this dance?

22:09.560 --> 22:11.390
What?! Uh...

22:12.340 --> 22:13.430
What's the matter?

22:13.430 --> 22:17.250
Prince Clarke, is this who we really are?

22:17.250 --> 22:18.120
Huh?

22:20.030 --> 22:22.100
Now, let us be on our way...

22:22.100 --> 22:24.690
Your Royal Highness 
Crown Prince Clarke Astarl!

22:27.280 --> 22:29.950
Oh boy. You really are something.
